{"ticker":"CMG","updated":"2026-11-13T22:53:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc.","shortName":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","country":"United States","website":"https://www.chipotle.com","fullTimeEmployees":140000,"marketCap":44628316160,"trailingPE":32.97196,"forwardPE":26.633852,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5103154,"pegRatio":1.88,"targetMeanPrice":40.56667,"targetHighPrice":53.0,"targetLowPrice":32.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":30,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.096,"earningsGrowth":-0.062,"grossMargins":0.39314,"operatingMargins":0.14715,"profitMargins":0.10832,"totalRevenue":12713477120,"beta":0.986,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":41.42,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":27.31,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, owns and operates Chipotle Mexican Grill restaurants. The company sells food and beverages, such as burritos, burrito bowls, quesadillas, tacos, and salads, as well as kids' meals, chips, and sides. It also offers Mexican-inspired meals using responsibly sourced meats, such as chicken, beef, and pork under the Responsibly Raised brand. In addition, the company provides digital ordering through its website, mobile app, and third-party delivery platforms. It operates in the United States, Canada, France, Germany, South Korea, and the United Kingdom. Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Newport Beach, California.","summary_zh":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. 及其子公司擁有並經營 Chipotle Mexican Grill 餐廳。該公司銷售食品和飲料，如墨西哥捲餅、墨西哥捲餅碗、玉米煎餅、玉米餅和沙拉，以及兒童餐、薯條和配菜。它還提供墨西哥風味餐點，採用負責任採購的肉類，例如“Responsively Raising”品牌下的雞肉、牛肉和豬肉。此外，該公司還透過其網站、行動應用程式和第三方交付平台提供數位訂購服務。它在美國、加拿大、法國、德國、韓國和英國運營。 Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. 成立於 1993 年，總部位於加州紐波特海灘。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"餐廳","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":38.7,"h":39.04,"l":38.42,"c":38.58,"v":19221300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":